/-! # FLOWER-LOW (packet L8), item I (wave 3): the marking functions over `𝒱_γ`

Main's `Flower.MkDefs.Intrinsic`, `Flower.MkMark.*`, `Flower.MkMarkX.*` declarations on item I's path (the intrinsic
markings `markI`, the marking count and the batch transport of markings), copied by source (sha256 in
COPIED-SHA256SUMS) onto L5a's `Fama.Stage1Mk.MarkFn γ` and the carrier `Src`. Generated by `tools/itool/gen_i_spec.py`. -/

