variable {γF : ℝ} [Fact (γF ≤ 1 / 2)] [Fact Fama.TVineF1Input] [Fact Fama.VinechainlemPrimeInput] [Fact Fama.TVineIsoInvariant]
variable {w : ℕ} {G : Garden w}

/-- The designated object of a group with a joint of the kind HV, VC or HVC has the atoms of the whole group
(the clauses of the successor `IsDesig`). -/
theorem desig_atoms_eqLow {S : Finset (GBranch G.tree)} {a : GBranch G.tree} {O : Src.Object γF G.molecule}
    (hdes : Fama.VineA.NormalizedSplice.IsDesig γF G S a O)
    (hvl : ∃ a b, Src.IsHV γF G.molecule S a b ∨ Src.IsVC γF G.molecule S a b ∨ Src.IsHVC γF G.molecule S a b) : O.atoms = S := by
  rcases hsk : (Fama.groupUnitsOf γF G S).skip with _ | sk
  · by_cases hu : (Fama.groupUnitsOf γF G S).units = []
    · exact hdes.2.2.2.2.2.2.1 hsk hu hvl
    · exact (hdes.2.2.2.2.1 hsk hu).1
  · rcases hb : sk.bond with _ | e
    · exact (hdes.2.2.1 sk hsk hb).1
    · exact (hdes.2.2.2.1 sk e hsk hb).1

end

